<title>CHILE: Codelco workers vote to lift strike.</title>
<headline>Codelco workers vote to lift strike.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO, CHILE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at Codelco's Salvador mine voted to lift their strike as of Saturday after a 24-hour walkout, an official for the state copper company said.</p>
</text>
